     "pop_html": "<strong>Morning Pass</strong> with locker, entry 7:00–9:00: €39 · <strong>Weekday Pass</strong> with locker: €46 · <strong>Weekday Pass</strong> with private cabin: €50. You stay as long as you like on the day.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">Prices for Thursday 19 November 2026.</span>"
    },
