     "cls": "bpa-lang bpa-time",
     "emoji": "🕒",
     "label": "Fri open to 22:00",
     "pop_html": "<strong>Mon–Thu</strong> 7:00–20:00 · <strong>Fri</strong> 7:00–22:00 · <strong>Sat–Sun</strong> 8:00–20:00. 8 December 2026: closes at 16:00. 18 December 2026 to 6 January 2027: opens at 8:00. 25 and 26 December and 1 January: opens at 10:00.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">From szechenyifurdo.hu; hours change on holidays.</span>"
    },
    {
     "cls": "bpa-lang",
     "emoji": "🔐",
     "label": "Locker vs cabin",
     "pop_html": "<strong>Locker:</strong> a numbered locker in the shared, gender-separated changing room, opened with a wristband (3,000 HUF if lost). <strong>Cabin:</strong> a lockable changing booth for you (or two of you) where you also leave your things; €4 more online, 1,000 HUF more at the desk.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">From szechenyifurdo.hu and the ticket listing.</span>"
    },
    {
     "cls": "bpa-lang",
     "emoji": "🚪",
     "label": "Skips the cashier",
     "pop_html": "Booked tickets open the turnstile at the self-service validation machines by the swimming-pool entrance, so you walk past the cashier queue.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">From the ticket listing and my own visit.</span>"
    }
   ],
